248
00:19:36,767 --> 00:19:40,767
and their king was even allowed to participate in the world's summit.

249
00:19:41,907 --> 00:19:46,067
But, despite that, humans still had hate in their hearts.

250
00:19:47,067 --> 00:19:51,227
The beginning of the Great Pirate Era was probably the worst time in my life.

251
00:19:51,747 --> 00:19:53,107
It was hard to be a fish man.

252
00:19:54,187 --> 00:19:55,767
I vividly remember my fear.

253
00:19:56,047 --> 00:19:58,207
Human pirates running wild on the island.

254
00:19:58,827 --> 00:20:00,687
Anywhere you went seemed dangerous.

255
00:20:01,527 --> 00:20:03,847
So much violence, I'll never forget.

256
00:20:06,767 --> 00:20:11,427
Our only safe place in the world was taken over by humans.

257
00:20:13,627 --> 00:20:15,707
Then came that fateful day.

258
00:20:16,327 --> 00:20:18,687
Whitebeard arrived on the island and saved us.

259
00:20:21,067 --> 00:20:23,587
He made his powerful presence felt,

260
00:20:23,987 --> 00:20:25,847
claiming Fishman Island as his own.

261
00:20:26,747 --> 00:20:27,847
Because of him,

262
00:20:28,467 --> 00:20:30,427
peace returned to our home.

263
00:20:30,427 --> 00:20:32,647
However,

264
00:20:32,647 --> 00:20:36,387
humans continue to be prejudiced towards fish men.

265
00:20:37,287 --> 00:20:40,987
All of you saw it firsthand at the Saba Odi Archipelago.

266
00:20:42,087 --> 00:20:43,707
That's the cruel reality.

267
00:20:46,087 --> 00:20:46,727
Naturally,

268
00:20:47,227 --> 00:20:48,887
once someone attains power,

269
00:20:49,267 --> 00:20:51,507
they tend to be resistant to change.

270
00:20:51,507 --> 00:20:56,507
Even though the government theoretically bridged the gap between fish men and humans,

271
00:20:57,167 --> 00:21:00,087
the worst bigots were the people in control to begin with.

272
00:21:00,527 --> 00:21:02,587
The ones who should be leading by example.

273
00:21:04,027 --> 00:21:04,327
Thus,

274
00:21:04,407 --> 00:21:07,667
the relationship between fish men and humans remained the same.

275
00:21:08,867 --> 00:21:09,287
Thankfully,

276
00:21:09,847 --> 00:21:12,207
two individuals rose up on Fishman Island.

277
00:21:12,947 --> 00:21:16,207
Individuals who would help change the course of our beleaguered history.

278
00:21:16,207 --> 00:21:17,687
The first

279
00:21:17,687 --> 00:21:20,687
was Queen Otohime.

280
00:21:21,887 --> 00:21:25,447
She believed we islanders could live in harmony with humans.

281
00:21:26,087 --> 00:21:28,227
She was Princess Shirohoshi's mother.

282
00:21:29,667 --> 00:21:30,847
Then there was him,

283
00:21:31,147 --> 00:21:33,587
the legendary hero named Fisher Tiger,

284
00:21:33,947 --> 00:21:35,947
who freed countless slaves.

285
00:21:36,047 --> 00:21:37,267
That tiger guy, huh?

286
00:21:37,787 --> 00:21:39,267
I think I've heard the name before.

287
00:21:39,547 --> 00:21:41,647
To set himself apart from the humans,

288
00:21:42,827 --> 00:21:44,687
Tiger broke an unspoken rule,

289
00:21:44,687 --> 00:21:48,087
invading the Holy Land of Marie-Joie by himself

290
00:21:48,087 --> 00:21:49,807
and freeing the slaves within.

291
00:21:51,527 --> 00:21:54,107
He would go on to form the Sun Pirates.

292
00:21:54,627 --> 00:21:58,427
Many of its members were fish men who were formerly slaves of the nobles.

293
00:21:59,487 --> 00:22:00,507
Sun Pirates?

294
00:22:00,627 --> 00:22:00,947
Indeed.

295
00:22:01,587 --> 00:22:02,447
You know them

296
00:22:02,447 --> 00:22:03,847
as Arlong,

297
00:22:04,587 --> 00:22:04,967
Hachi,

298
00:22:06,007 --> 00:22:06,947
and myself.

299
00:22:09,207 --> 00:22:13,027
The three of us were part of the very first crew of the Sun Pirates.

300
00:22:13,027 --> 00:22:17,967
But we were known as Fish Man Pirates,

301
00:22:18,187 --> 00:22:19,307
foes of the world government.

302
00:22:19,727 --> 00:22:20,867
That's all that they saw.

303
00:22:21,687 --> 00:22:22,067
Therefore,

304
00:22:22,747 --> 00:22:25,747
we made it that much more difficult for Queen Otohime.

305
00:22:26,327 --> 00:22:27,167
Bless her heart,

306
00:22:27,587 --> 00:22:29,947
our existence prevented much progress.

307
00:22:32,427 --> 00:22:37,227
Queen Otohime was trying to navigate great hardships and improve our future.

308
00:22:37,227 --> 00:22:39,247
At the same time,

309
00:22:39,707 --> 00:22:44,607
Fisher Tiger threw his future away to save those of his race who were suffering as slaves.

310
00:22:45,807 --> 00:22:48,407
No one can say who was right or wrong.

311
00:22:52,507 --> 00:22:53,107
Nevertheless,

312
00:22:53,927 --> 00:22:57,807
they both fought for a better future for fish men and humans.

313
00:22:58,467 --> 00:22:59,667
Each one is a legend.

314
00:22:59,667 --> 00:23:04,547
And both of their tales end in tragedy.

315
00:23:08,827 --> 00:23:14,787
Queen Otohime tries to lead the Ryugu kingdom into an era of coexistence between humans and fish men.

316
00:23:15,287 --> 00:23:15,687
Meanwhile,

317
00:23:15,887 --> 00:23:19,647
the heroic Fisher Tiger battles humans to free their slaves from captivity.

318
00:23:19,647 --> 00:23:22,347
When the tales of these two historic figures cross,

319
00:23:22,667 --> 00:23:23,607
for better or for worse,

320
00:23:23,947 --> 00:23:27,067
the fate of Fish Man Island will be immeasurably changed.

321
00:23:27,527 --> 00:23:28,207
On the next,

322
00:23:28,347 --> 00:23:28,887
One Piece,

323
00:23:29,187 --> 00:23:31,067
a hero who freed the slaves,

324
00:23:31,347 --> 00:23:32,547
an adventurer tiger.

325
00:23:33,047 --> 00:23:34,707
I'm going to be king of the pirates.

